  "result": "Perfect! All 55 tests pass. I've added invoice numbering functionality:\n\n**New `src/numbering.js`:**\n\n**`nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`** \u2014 generates the next invoice number\n- Format: `INV-YYYY-CCCC` where YYYY is year and CCCC is zero-padded 4-digit counter\n- Counter starts at 0001 and resets every year\n- Finds the highest counter for the year and returns the next one\n- Handles out-of-order existing numbers\n\n**Added to `src/invoices.js`:**\n\n**`issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)`** \u2014 issues a draft invoice\n- Only works on draft invoices (returns NOT_DRAFT otherwise)\n- Assigns next available number for the invoice's issue date\n- Changes status to 'issued'\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)`, never mutates original\n- Preserves all invoice data (customerId, issueDate, lines)\n\n**Added comprehensive test suite** (11 new tests):\n- First invoice generation for each year\n- Counter incrementing within same year\n- Counter reset for new years\n- Out-of-order existing numbers\n- Max counter detection across multiple years\n- Zero-padding verification\n- issueInvoice with various scenarios\n- Non-draft invoice rejection\n- Input immutability\n- Data preservation",
